---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Submission received">
  <header class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero-inner">
      <div class="page-hero-eyebrow">Corrections · Submission received</div>
      <h1>Got it. A human will <em>read it</em>.</h1>
      <p class="page-hero-lede">
        Your submission landed. The registry replies to every substantive message within five business days. If your note triggers a change to a published case, the change appears on the Corrections page with the date and the source that prompted it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="prose">
    <p>If you don't hear back inside five business days, your message may have been filtered as spam. Send a follow-up to <a href="/corrections#submit">the same form</a> and note that it's a resend.</p>
    <p>
      <a href="/corrections">← Back to Corrections</a> · <a href="/cases">Browse the registry</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
